	<TextRow
		Label="msg_oldc01r0501_old_leader1c_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>デント『ポッド　きいてる？▼
もっと　べんきょうして
はやく　いちにんまえの▽
ジムリーダーに　ならないと……▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T06:10:41" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T06:10:15" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>デント『ポッド　きいてる？▼
もっと　勉強して
はやく　一人前の▽
ジムリーダーに　ならないと……▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T06:53:33" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T06:01:21" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・続けて</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T06:01:27" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>OLD_LEADER1C
デント</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T06:01:01" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>A</Text>
