	<TextRow
		Label="msg_oldc01r0501_old_ninja3_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ダーク『……きまぐれ▼
……うさばらし▼
……ひまつぶし▼
なんでも　いい▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-19T13:02:54" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T05:47:35" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ダーク『……気まぐれ▼
……憂さ晴らし▼
……暇つぶし▼
なんでも　いい▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-19T13:03:18" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T05:47:35" />
		</LanguageCell>
